        "explanation": "Optional Chaining `?.` is an operator that permits reading the value of a property located deep within a chain of connected objects without having to check that each reference in the chain is valid. If the reference is `null` or `undefined`, the expression safely short-circuits and returns `undefined` rather than throwing an error.",
